    "manas-2010:p1644:b001:l024": "Каканчынын provisionally understood as of the kakan, rather than an independently established city-name Kakanchy; exact naming status uncertain.",
    "manas-2010:p1645:b001:l015": "Тебереки provisionally read as an irregular proximal expression related to береки, that nearby; exact form unresolved. No new city-name manufactured. Каканчынын remains the kakan reading used1644:24.",
    "manas-2010:p1645:b001:l016": "Кылдаткер understood as skilled practitioners from their remedy preparation and treatment; no modern medical specialization inferred.",
