    "manas-2010:p1648:b001:l009": "Printed күл is a documented variant of гүл, flower (Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/КҮЛ/), not necessarily ashes or a printing error. Entire мыйзамдын гүлү expression is autumn gossamer, with this exact neighboring-line formula in Yudakhin https://el-sozduk.kg/myyzam-6/.",
    "manas-2010:p1648:b001:l015": "Abrupt nominal valley/lance couplet retained; no missing verb supplied as certain.",
